	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">Exploration and experimentation - At this very early stage, the entirety of Yomonsni is being created. Techniques and practices are being explored and ideas are being formulated, experiemented with and evaluated.</p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">Build successes - In the limited practice so far, there has already been some success stories. More need to be accumulated, and testimonials written.</p>
